WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
The cleaning dock shows water levels and completes a station-cleaning cycle.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
The lamp changes to blue and rose, turns off, then comes back on.

00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
The sheer curtain moves halfway across the window. The blackout layer closes.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.000
A moving mountain landscape appears above the projector.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
The viewpoint moves through the room, then returns to a wider view.
